{"id":46477,"date":"2025-11-10T22:12:21","date_gmt":"2025-11-10T21:12:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=46477"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:39:05","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:39:05","slug":"maratona-de-nova-iorque","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-nova-iorque\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Nova Iorque 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Nova Iorque 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>TCS New York City Marathon 2026 (Maratona de Nova Iorque)<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>1 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na m\u00edtica cidade de <strong>Nova Iorque<\/strong>, nos <strong>Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/strong>. Organizada pelo prestigiado clube <strong>New York Road Runners (NYRR)<\/strong> com o patroc\u00ednio da <strong>Tata Consultancy Services (TCS)<\/strong>, a prova \u00e9 a maior e mais emblem\u00e1tica maratona do planeta e membro integrante das <strong>Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/strong>, congregando mais de 50.000 maratonistas de mais de 150 pa\u00edses e milh\u00f5es de espetadores nas ruas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida \u00e9pica na <strong>Ponte Verrazzano-Narrows em Staten Island<\/strong> e meta consagrada no ic\u00f3nico <strong>Central Park em Manhattan<\/strong>, os atletas percorrem os <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> atravessando os cinco famosos distritos nova-iorquinos: <strong>Staten Island, Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx e Manhattan<\/strong>. Uma experi\u00eancia atl\u00e9tica inigual\u00e1vel que combina a energia vibrante de dezenas de bandas ao vivo com o apoio ensurdecedor do p\u00fablico nova-iorquino.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ponte Verrazzano-Narrows (Staten Island) \/ Central Park, Nova Iorque, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42.195 km (Maratona Oficial Abbott World Marathon Major)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">New York Road Runners (NYRR) \/ TCS<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h30<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TCS New York City Marathon 42K (Abbott Major)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 1 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sorteio &#038; Qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong> Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es NYRR<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Plataforma Oficial)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Maratona de Nova Iorque 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se tradicionalmente no primeiro domingo de novembro, a 1 de novembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio a partir das 08:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o percurso da TCS New York City Marathon?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A maratona parte da Ponte Verrazzano-Narrows em Staten Island e percorre Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx e Manhattan, terminando no Central Park.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como \u00e9 poss\u00edvel obter dorsal para correr em Nova Iorque?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As entradas s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddas atrav\u00e9s de sorteio oficial da NYRR, tempos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o por idade\/g\u00e9nero, operadores tur\u00edsticos oficiais ou angaria\u00e7\u00e3o de fundos solid\u00e1ria.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova faz parte das World Marathon Majors?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a Maratona de Nova Iorque \u00e9 uma das seis prestigiadas Abbott World Marathon Majors juntamente com T\u00f3quio, Boston, Londres, Berlim e Chicago.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite oficial de conclus\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite oficial para ser classificado como finalista e receber a medalha no Central Park \u00e9 de 6 horas e 30 minutos a partir da \u00faltima vaga de partida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Nova Iorque 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-01\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ponte Verrazzano-Narrows (Staten Island) \/ Central Park\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Nova Iorque\", \"addressRegion\": \"Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"addressCountry\": \"US\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"New York Road Runners (NYRR) \/ TCS\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Maratona de Nova Iorque 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se tradicionalmente no primeiro domingo de novembro, a 1 de novembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio a partir das 08:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o percurso da TCS New York City Marathon?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A maratona parte da Ponte Verrazzano-Narrows em Staten Island e percorre Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx e Manhattan, terminando no Central Park.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como \u00e9 poss\u00edvel obter dorsal para correr em Nova Iorque?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As entradas s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddas atrav\u00e9s de sorteio oficial da NYRR, tempos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o por idade\/g\u00e9nero, operadores tur\u00edsticos oficiais ou angaria\u00e7\u00e3o de fundos solid\u00e1ria.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova faz parte das World Marathon Majors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a Maratona de Nova Iorque \u00e9 uma das seis prestigiadas Abbott World Marathon Majors juntamente com T\u00f3quio, Boston, Londres, Berlim e Chicago.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite oficial de conclus\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite oficial para ser classificado como finalista e receber a medalha no Central Park \u00e9 de 6 horas e 30 minutos a partir da \u00faltima vaga de partida.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66297,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[1069,1070],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[1096],"class_list":["post-46477","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-nova-iorque-estados-unidos-da-america","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-america","event_type_2-usa","event_type_5-majors"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-nova-iorque-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46477","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=46477"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46477\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":65946,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_eve